Gujarat's Mystery Well Baffles Locals As Strange Waves Ripple Across Water
An unusual wave-like movement inside a farm well in Gujarat's Morbi district has puzzled villagers and drawn official attention. District geologists believe trapped air beneath the water may be causing the ripples, while the Gujarat Groundwater Research Institute conducts a detailed investigation.
